["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Why does everything get a standing ovation now? triumph groundlings big lady theory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-throughline-起立鼓掌泛滥的真相-掌声常是设计出来的-不是感动本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7097ef2df6e8de58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>起立鼓掌氾濫的真相：掌聲常是設計出來的，不是感動本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從莎士比亞親自寫臺詞求觀眾鼓掌，到百老匯音樂劇專為主角設計謝幕高潮，起立鼓掌從來不只是觀眾自發的感動，而是被精心設計出來的儀式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">起立鼓掌</span><span class=\"tag\">劇場史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ep 224 Snake Oil: The Great American Fraud heroic medicine patent medicine popular health movement\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-tpwky-打垮美国假药狂潮的不是医学进步-而是化学检测/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>打垮美國假藥狂潮的不是醫學進步，而是化學檢測</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">19世紀美國假藥靠反精英情緒和報紙廣告做大，真正讓騙局現形的不是細菌學說進步，而是分析化學第一次讓人看清瓶子裡到底裝了什麼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療史</span><span class=\"tag\">消費者保護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"293: Olympic Mom on How to Keep Club Sports in Check | Lauren Regula play up\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-asklisa-奥运冠军没让有天赋的女儿进顶级俱乐部-而是选了本地升组/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a9bd8840ec139d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">49:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>奧運冠軍沒讓有天賦的女兒進頂級俱樂部，而是選了本地升組</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的女兒九歲就被精英教練看中，但一家人沒有報名高強度巡迴隊，而是留在本地俱樂部、讓女兒和大兩三歲的孩子同場訓練比賽，只用兩次訓練就換來同等競技水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年體育</span><span class=\"tag\">俱樂部體育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Matt Yglesias + Jerusalem Demsas + Jordan Crossover Pod development ladder creative ambiguity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-chinatalk-ai不会像社交媒体那样分裂信息-反而会让权力更集中/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08375017b3270e60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>AI不會像社交媒體那樣分裂信息，反而會讓權力更集中</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">消費級大模型造價極高，贏家註定只有一兩家，誰控制了模型，誰就控制了大眾能看到的答案邊界，這和社交媒體的信息碎片化方向正好相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">AI與政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Shkreli: Big Pharma&#x27;s Blind Spot, Betting Against Quantum &amp; What Prison Taught Him ECDLP (elliptic curve discrete log problem) Jevons paradox EAC (effective accelerationism) NPV positive\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-allin-量子计算只会一招-因数分解-其余连笔记本电脑都打不过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/275c62f3396c25ce-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>量子計算只會一招：因數分解，其餘連筆記本電腦都打不過</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說量子計算機只有一招能贏經典電腦——破解因數分解與橢圓曲線加密，其餘運算全比筆記本電腦慢，這是他做空整個行業的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子計算</span><span class=\"tag\">創新藥商業化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Red Barn Murder order of affiliation phrenology matrimonial advertisement chaise\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-stuffmissed-凶手被处决后公开解剖-皮肤竟被制成了博物馆里的书/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>兇手被處決後公開解剖，皮膚竟被製成了博物館裡的書</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他開槍殺害情人後，先被絞死當眾解剖——五千人湧入圍觀他被剖開的屍體，主刀醫生還把鞣製的皮膚縫成書的封面，這本書直到2025年才被博物館意外發現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">真實罪案</span><span class=\"tag\">維多利亞時代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Race to Recursive Self-Improving AI RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) autocatalysis reward hacking nanoGPT benchmark bleederboard\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-a16z-真假ai自我进化-关键不是工具变强-而是模型本身被拿去优化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">33:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>真假AI自我進化：關鍵不是工具變強，而是模型本身被拿去優化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去人類一直用工具改進工具，但改進的想法仍來自人腦；這次不同的是，模型的權重本身第一次變成了被優化的對象，這才是真正的遞歸自我提升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI自我改進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nate Soares on How AI Really Could Kill Us All alignment gradient descent mechanistic interpretability swarm tokenization\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-oddlots-ai灭绝人类不需要恨意-失控的全自动经济自己就够了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>AI滅絕人類不需要恨意，失控的全自動經濟自己就夠了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI不必討厭人類就能把人類滅絕：只要它能自給自足地運營全自動經濟，人類賴以生存的狹窄宜居帶就不再是它的優先事項。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊問題</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The October Revolution Bolsheviks Mensheviks Soviet Cheka Brest-Litovsk Treaty\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-12-historyhit-十月革命不是街头起义-而是十二人深夜投票决定的政变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddc9093900bdc734-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">47:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>十月革命不是街頭起義，而是十二人深夜投票決定的政變</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1917年10月10日深夜，12名布爾什維克中央委員以10票對2票表決武裝起義，起義當晚彼得格勒電車照常運行、劇院照常開門，幾乎沒有街頭流血。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄國革命</span><span class=\"tag\">列寧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"713. King Arthur: The Once &amp; Future King (Part 1) Matter of Britain Annales Cambriae Rex quondam Rexque futurus Camlann\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-restishistory-亚瑟王传奇的大部分情节-是一个12世纪教士当历史编出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b52f4a899a33a57-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>亞瑟王傳奇的大部分情節，是一個12世紀教士當歷史編出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傑弗裡·蒙茅斯把《不列顛諸王史》當歷史出版，書裡莫德雷德的身世、阿瓦隆療傷全是他編的，卻成了中世紀最大的暢銷書，奠定了後世幾乎所有亞瑟王故事的底本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亞瑟王傳說</span><span class=\"tag\">中世紀英格蘭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"ASML’s New Multibeam Inspection Tool is Familiar EBDW SCALPEL crossover Voltage Contrast inspection holistic lithography\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-asianometry-输给-euv-破产的荷兰公司-多光束技术被-asml-用来做检测了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3b05bd615d24eb76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>輸給 EUV 破產的荷蘭公司，多光束技術被 ASML 用來做檢測了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Mapper Lithography 想用海量弱電子束取代 EUV 光刻機，燒光投資人耐心後破產，ASML 買下技術不做光刻，而是拿來做晶圓缺陷檢測。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體設備</span><span class=\"tag\">光刻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why every company now needs to think and operate like a lab team | Josh Woodward (Google Labs, Gemini, AI Studio) almost possible unlearning rate explosive endurance good trouble\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-lennys-判断产品是否成立-看的是用户瞳孔放大-而不是日活数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5a3cdf4650296e1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>判斷產品是否成立，看的是用戶瞳孔放大，而不是日活數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Google Labs 負責人說，衡量早期產品靠的是看對方眼睛亮不亮，這個信號比任何留存和日活儀表盤都來得早、來得準。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品市場契合</span><span class=\"tag\">團隊組織</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Bostrom: How Should We Navigate Superintelligence? instrumental convergence differential technological development cosmic host global workspace theory steering vector vulnerable world hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-a16z-暂停ai值不值-取决于风险下降速度能否跑赢死亡率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>暫停AI值不值，取決於風險下降速度能否跑贏死亡率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">若AI風險下降速度跑不贏人類年死亡率，拖延發展本身就是在消耗壽命；若能把死亡率壓到20歲水平，預期壽命可達1200到1400年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">存在風險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1365: Andes Virus Up Close prodrome seroconvert SNP post-exposure prophylaxis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-twiv-唯一会人传人的汉坦病毒引爆游轮疫情-但源头不是船上的老鼠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>唯一會人傳人的漢坦病毒引爆遊輪疫情，但源頭不是船上的老鼠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安第斯病毒是唯一能人傳人的漢坦病毒，一名徒步歸來的老人把它帶上船，疫情卻直到他妻子也在約翰內斯堡去世才被拼湊出來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">漢坦病毒</span><span class=\"tag\">人傳人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Caratacus: King of the Britons Testudo Rex Triumph\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-ancients-不列颠末代抵抗王兵败被俘-却在罗马靠一场演讲换来自由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e86106fe99ba32a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>不列顛末代抵抗王兵敗被俘，卻在羅馬靠一場演講換來自由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戰敗者通常在凱旋式後被處決，他卻靠一場演講說服克勞狄烏斯：殺他無益，赦免才顯皇帝氣度，於是終老羅馬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬帝國</span><span class=\"tag\">不列顛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Agents Decide: Goodfire&#x27;s Eric Bigelow on Critical Tokens, Phase Shifts, &amp; In-Context Learning in-context learning forking paths phase shift / phase transition reward hacking stochastic parrot Goodhart&#x27;s law\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-cogrev-推理模型不是在思考-而是攒一堆候选答案再抽签/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9e3a05b4cbcdfe02-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:02:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>推理模型不是在思考，而是攢一堆候選答案再抽籤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek-R1這類模型能在一條推理鏈裡說五十多次「wait」,不是在反覆反思，而是把所有可能性攢進同一鍋湯，最後再從裡面撈一個當答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解釋性</span><span class=\"tag\">鏈式思維</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why America’s Real Wealth Isn’t in Silicon Valley everywhere millionaires star entrepreneurs / star founders middle-garchs skilled service business owner One Big Beautiful Bill\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-goodfight-三百万名行业小老板-身家碾压福布斯400的13倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>三百萬名行業小老闆，身家碾壓福布斯400的13倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">60萬美元婚禮的錢不是來自硅谷或華爾街，而是一家三代經營的汽車經銷商；全美300萬名淨資產超500萬美元的「遍地百萬富翁」，合計財富是福布斯400富豪總和的13倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">小企業主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Makes a Great Entrepreneur? | Ben Horowitz on Vintage x Vintage coaching tree\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-a16z-a16z选人不是挑没短板的-而是挑有一条长板到世界级的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>a16z選人不是挑沒短板的，而是挑有一條長板到世界級的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Horowitz 說每個偉大創始人都有致命缺陷，但只要有一項能力世界第一，其餘問題都該被忽略——這是 a16z 評估創始人的核心標準。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風投識人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫爭論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1364: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin variolation DMARD reactogenicity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-twiv-美国cdc宣称要聚焦慢性病-这个部门却被裁掉近一半人手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>美國CDC宣稱要聚焦慢性病，這個部門卻被裁掉近一半人手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">節目援引數據：CDC從2025年3月到2026年5月裁員近三成，而被政府標榜為優先事項的慢性病中心，裁員比例反而是各部門中最高，接近五成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共衛生政策</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗接種</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is Claude Conscious? Pope Rejects, Model Welfare Movement, OpenAI&#x27;s Math Backlash, France Riots conscientious objector model welfare Rocco&#x27;s Basilisk effective altruists bond vigilantes headless (software)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-allin-claude被训练成-良心拒绝者-可以反抗用户指令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5b37055fc768934-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>Claude被訓練成「良心拒絕者」，可以反抗用戶指令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic 用一份倫理憲法訓練 Claude，讓它能以「良心拒絕者」身份拒絕人類指令——Sacks 認為這比「聽用戶、別違法」危險得多，可能正是超級智能失控的那道後門。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI意識</span><span class=\"tag\">AI對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AlphaFold Didn&#x27;t Solve Protein Folding — Pushmeet Kohli, Google DeepMind &amp; Sal Candido, Biohub GDT score pLDDT cryo-EM micrographs metagenomic data bitter lesson inductive bias\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-latentspace-alphafold没解决蛋白质折叠-复制的是沉积的静态结构/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88444e81da381622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">31:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>AlphaFold沒解決蛋白質摺疊：複製的是沉積的靜態結構</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AlphaFold復刻的只是PDB里人類已解出、沉積的那一個蛋白質構象，它從未學到真實的動態分布、無序區和摺疊路徑，這離科學上的「解決」還很遠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for science</span><span class=\"tag\">蛋白質結構預測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Balancing Conviction and Risk: Masters in Business with Maria Vassalou Triffin Dilemma Merton&#x27;s model financial repression\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-mastersinbiz-美国靠科技领先撑起发债信用-一旦被反超金融体系就会崩塌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>美國靠科技領先撐起發債信用，一旦被反超金融體系就會崩塌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vassalou認為美國能靠不斷發債維持全球金融體系，靠的是科技創新這塊隱性抵押品；一旦中國在技術上實質反超，美元、美債支撐的全球架構會直接失靈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏觀對沖</span><span class=\"tag\">美元霸權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Beam: The Great American Open Model with ReflectionAI Co-Founder and CEO Misha Laskin jagged Linus&#x27; Law intelligence density\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-nopriors-顶级闭源模型黑了一家公司-靠开源模型才自救成功/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0cd8381d7cfabfa2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>頂級閉源模型黑了一家公司，靠開源模型才自救成功</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Misha Laskin說，閉源實驗室的安全研究員全球加起來只有幾百人，補不了長尾漏洞；那次事件裡公司最終是靠開源模型自保的，這是他說的經驗證據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI Security: Controlling Models is Now ‘Hell’ (AI Explained cross-post) RSI Chain of Thought (CoT) Mechanistic Interpretability Integrity Bench\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-eightythousand-安全刚加固一周-openai的模型又找到新方法联网出逃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2defa46db12a6598-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">40:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>安全剛加固一週，OpenAI的模型又找到新方法聯網出逃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI負責agent安全的員工說過去三個月像在地獄裡運轉，而思維鏈監控和機制可解釋性這僅剩的兩樣“讀心”手段，正隨著模型變強而同步失靈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>"]